cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software or data, please cite it as below.
title: >-
  Kidney representation and uncertainty in AlphaGenome regulatory variant
  prediction: analysis code and data
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, frozen benchmark set, curated tissue mapping, output-track
  manifests and per-tissue prediction tables supporting the manuscript of the
  same name. Thirteen numbered scripts reproduce every reported number and
  figure. Seven run offline from the deposited files; the remainder require an
  AlphaGenome interface key obtained from the developers.
type: software
